{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SioP8bCr3JfRnVDGFfV3Tw","type":"tool_result","content":"  67603 API.md\n 192446 API-INDEX.md\n 114712 AI_GUIDE.md\n   6295 README.md\n1234180 my-3d2dge.js\n1615236 total\ndocs:\nASSETS.md\n\ngame:\ngame.js\nindex.html\ntest.mjs\n\nkits:\nREADME.md\nadventure.html\nadventure.js\nanimlab.html\nanimlab.js\narcade.html\narcade.js\nartillery.html\nartillery.js\nbrawler.html\nbrawler.js\nfighting.html\nfighting.js\nkart.html\nkart.js\nmetroidvania.html\nmetroidvania.js\npinball.html\npinball.js\nplatformer.html\nplatformer.js\npointclick.html\npointclick.js\npuzzle.html\npuzzle.js\nrhythm.html\nrhythm.js\nroad.html\nroad.js\nroguelike.html\nroguelike.js\nrpg.html\nrpg.js\nrts.html\nrts.js\nshooter.html\nshooter.js\nsim.html\nsim.js\nsports.html\nsports.js\nstealth.html\nstealth.js\ntactics.html\ntactics.js\ntest.mjs\n\nmodules:\narcade.js\nclick.js\ndrive.js\nfight.js\ngen.js\ngrid.js\nmode7.js\nphysics.js\nrhythm.js\nroad.js\nrooms.js\nrpg.js\nsongs.js\nstory.js\nstrategy.js\nterrain.js\n\nsrc:\nassets\n\ntools:\nasset-find.mjs\nasset-lib.mjs\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-3d2dge-handoff\",\n  \"version\": \"0.85.2\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"description\": \"my-3D2dge for coding agents: the engine, its card, index and guide, the tools and a template game\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"test\": \"node game/test.mjs\",\n    \"check\": \"node tools/check.mjs game/index.html\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"playwright\": \"1.63.0\"\n  }\n}\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>my-3D2dge handoff package</title>\n<style>\n  :root { color-scheme: light dark; --ink: #1b1726; --paper: #f6f3ee; --line: #d8d2c8; --accent: #6a4ad0 }\n  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { :root { --ink: #ece8f6; --paper: #15121c; --line: #3a3348; --accent: #a68cff } }\n  body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink); font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif }\n  main { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 16px 48px }\n  h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 0 0 .25rem } p { margin: .5rem 0 1rem }\n  ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line) }\n  li { padding: .6rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line) } a { color: var(--accent); font-family: ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace }\n  li span { display: block; font-size: .9rem; opacity: .8 }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>my-3D2dge handoff package</h1>\n<p>v0.85.2 · dev-build. Everything a coding agent needs to build, run, test and check a game on the full engine, as text files. Start with <a href=\"README.md\">README.md</a>, then read <a href=\"API.md\">API.md</a>. Play <a href=\"kits/README.md\">a genre kit</a> or <a href=\"game/index.html\">the template game</a>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"README.md\">README.md</a><span>start here: what the package holds, which page to read, how to run and test a game</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"package.json\">package.json</a><span>pins Playwright for the tools</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"my-3d2dge.js\">my-3d2dge.js</a><span>the full engine, readable: the core and every module</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"my-3d2dge-agent.js\">my-3d2dge-agent.js</a><span>the agent edition: the essential engine, its header a short manual</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/arcade.js\">modules/arcade.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: the coin-op's frame: scores, high-score tables and initials, lives, credits, turns, cards, the attract mode</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/click.js\">modules/click.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: point-and-click adventures: walk areas with holes, depth, hotspots, verbs, an inventory</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/drive.js\">modules/drive.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: cars on the ground plane, a race round a track, the drivers who race it</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/fight.js\">modules/fight.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: one-on-one fighting: fighters with frame data, guards, throws, specials, a meter; rounds; a CPU; training</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/gen.js\">modules/gen.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: generated maps: rooms and corridors, BSP, caves, mazes and scatter, from a seed</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/grid.js\">modules/grid.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: square and hex grids: paths, ranges, lines, fields of view, fog, groups, movers and turns</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/mode7.js\">modules/mode7.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: a perspective floor drawn a row at a time, a sky that turns with it, everything on it scaled by its distance</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/physics.js\">modules/physics.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: 2D rigid bodies: circles, boxes, polygons, segments; fast balls that never pass through</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/rhythm.js\">modules/rhythm.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: charts on a song's steps, judged on the music clock: combos, grades, holds, a highway</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/road.js\">modules/road.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: the pseudo-3D road: segments with curves and hills, lanes, rumble strips, roadside scenery, tunnels</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/rooms.js\">modules/rooms.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: a world of rooms joined at their edges, the map of what was explored, gates and saves</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/rpg.js\">modules/rpg.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: items, inventories, equipment, shops, a party's stats and levels, status, damage, encounters</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/songs.js\">modules/songs.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: the songbook: the kits' best songs and more, and jingles, tagged by mood</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/story.js\">modules/story.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: dialogue as data, flags and values, a quest log and emote balloons</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/strategy.js\">modules/strategy.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: real-time strategy and simulation: selection, orders, armies, production, resources, placement, fog, AI; a day clock, needs, overlays</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"modules/terrain.js\">modules/terrain.js</a><span>a module, loaded after the engine: destructible ground in the side plane: carved and added, walked on, drawn in chunks</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"API.md\">API.md</a><span>the API card: read it whole</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"API-INDEX.md\">API-INDEX.md</a><span>every public name, one line each: search it</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"AI_GUIDE.md\">AI_GUIDE.md</a><span>the guide: recipes, the look, heights, sessions</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"tools/check.mjs\">tools/check.mjs</a><span>plays a game headless and reports errors, screenshots and its snapshot</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"tools/filmstrip.mjs\">tools/filmstrip.mjs</a><span>records frames into one picture</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"tools/replay.mjs\">tools/replay.mjs</a><span>replays a recorded play session exactly</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"docs/ASSETS.md\">docs/ASSETS.md</a><span>the asset card: objects and materials as data (r.shape), the core library, writing one</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"tools/asset-find.mjs\">tools/asset-find.mjs</a><span>searches the core library and the store: node tools/asset-find.mjs \"tavern table\"</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"tools/asset-sheet.mjs\">tools/asset-sheet.mjs</a><span>draws an object in every view and says what reads badly</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"tools/asset-set.mjs\">tools/asset-set.mjs</a><span>cuts the few entries a game uses from the store's sets</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"tools/asset-lib.mjs\">tools/asset-lib.mjs</a><span>shared by the asset tools</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"game/game.js\">game/game.js</a><span>the template game: copy it</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"game/index.html\">game/index.html</a><span>the template game: play it</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"game/test.mjs\">game/test.mjs</a><span>its headless test: node game/test.mjs</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"kits/README.md\">kits/</a><span>the 22 genre kits, readable: each kit's game and the page that plays it (kits/arcade.html), the table of them, and their headless test (node kits/test.mjs)</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"src/assets/README.md\">src/assets/</a><span>the asset store: 29 sets of objects and materials converted from CC0 libraries, and their catalogs (docs/ASSETS.md, \"Make one\")</span></li>\n</ul>\n</main>","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"972ca841-0540-4c71-85fe-204eae6bea61","uuid":"f04dd000-d66e-44a5-9448-411a728c04c4","timestamp":"2026-11-04T01:50:34.465Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"  67603 API.md\n 192446 API-INDEX.md\n 114712 AI_GUIDE.md\n   6295 README.md\n1234180 my-3d2dge.js\n1615236 total\ndocs:\nASSETS.md\n\ngame:\ngame.js\nindex.html\ntest.mjs\n\nkits:\nREADME.md\nadventure.html\nadventure.js\nanimlab.html\nanimlab.js\narcade.html\narcade.js\nartillery.html\nartillery.js\nbrawler.html\nbrawler.js\nfighting.html\nfighting.js\nkart.html\nkart.js\nmetroidvania.html\nmetroidvania.js\npinball.html\npinball.js\nplatformer.html\nplatformer.js\npointclick.html\npointclick.js\npuzzle.html\npuzzle.js\nrhythm.html\nrhythm.js\nroad.html\nroad.js\nroguelike.html\nroguelike.js\nrpg.html\nrpg.js\nrts.html\nrts.js\nshooter.html\nshooter.js\nsim.html\nsim.js\nsports.html\nsports.js\nstealth.html\nstealth.js\ntactics.html\ntactics.js\ntest.mjs\n\nmodules:\narcade.js\nclick.js\ndrive.js\nfight.js\ngen.js\ngrid.js\nmode7.js\nphysics.js\nrhythm.js\nroad.js\nrooms.js\nrpg.js\nsongs.js\nstory.js\nstrategy.js\nterrain.js\n\nsrc:\nassets\n\ntools:\nasset-find.mjs\nasset-lib.mjs\n{\n  \"name\": \"my-3d2dge-handoff\",\n  \"version\": \"0.85.2\",\n  \"private\": true,\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"de