SL2); CHROMIUM',\n  'MODEL: ANTHROPIC, CLAUDE-HAIKU-5-5, REASONING EFFORT MEDIUM',\n  'USAGE: UNKNOWN',\n  '',\n  '#TESTING FEEDBACK',\n  'ISSUES CAUGHT: ABOUT EIGHT. TWO WERE BREAKING IN A BROWSER: THE CANVAS',\n  'DREW AT 300X150 (THE PAGE CSS WAS MISSING), AND THE FIRST FRAME RAN',\n  'BEFORE THE BOT FILE LOADED (A CRASH ON A DEEP LINK INTO ATTRACT).',\n  'OTHERS: THE OP2 QUOTA SHORT (HOSTAGE GUARDS NOT COUNTED), A RETURN',\n  'FROM DEV THAT WOULD RESTART THE BATTLE, HUD AND DEV LAYOUT OVERLAP.',\n  'MOST HELPFUL: THE BOT PLAYS EACH OPERATION TO ITS BOSS HEADLESS, AND',\n  'THE SCREENSHOTS, WHICH SHOWED THE CANVAS AND LAYOUT PROBLEMS.',\n  'LEAST HELPFUL: THE STUB-BUFFER DRAW PASS. IT ONLY SHOWS NO EXCEPTION.',\n  '',\n  '#ENGINE FEEDBACK',\n  'MOST LIKED: E.GAME GIVES SCENES, PAUSE, SETTINGS, INPUT PRESETS, AUDIO',\n  'AND A HEADLESS LOOP FOR TESTS. E.ARCADE GIVES THE TABLE AND INITIALS.',\n  'STUCK OR GUESSED: THE CANVAS SIZE (THE TEMPLATE CSS, COPIED), THE',\n  'FIRST FRAME RUNNING BEFORE LATER FILES LOAD, AND THE HASH DEEP LINKS.',\n  'MOST BUILT BY HAND: THE BATTLE RULES, THE RAIL AND BEAT GENERATOR,',\n  'THE TELEGRAPH RINGS, THE DEPTH PAINTER, THE HUD, AND THE BOT.',\n  'HARDEST: THE API CARD IS LONG AND THE PIXEL FUNCTIONS SNAP TO WHOLE',\n  'PIXELS, SO SCALED SPRITES NEED A RUN-LENGTH PAINTER OF MY OWN.',\n  'CHANGED IN THE ENGINE: NONE.',\n  'ONE CHANGE I WOULD MAKE: A CLEAR RULE FOR CANVAS SIZE WITH A FIXED RES.',\n  '',\n  '#PROMPT FEEDBACK',\n  'MOST LIKED: THE PLAN\\'S EXACT NAMES, FILES, TESTS AND DONE CRITERIA.',\n  'CONFUSING: THE TASK AND THE PLAN ASK FOR FAR MORE THAN ONE RUN FITS',\n  '(SIX OPERATIONS, AI HUB, LOCAL CO-OP, RIGS, MODE 7), AND THE PLAN',\n  'NAMES A DIFFERENT MODEL AND EFFORT FROM THE TASK. THE TASK WON.',\n  'HARDEST: MULTIPLAYER INTEGRATION, WHICH NEEDS THE HUB HARNESS.',\n  'WOULD CHANGE: SPLIT IT INTO MILESTONES, EACH WITH ITS OWN DONE LINE.',\n];\n})();\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":1,"newStart":1,"newLines":57,"lines":["-(() => { 'use strict'; globalThis.WP.CREDITS = globalThis.WP.ABOUT; })();","+// The About and Credits screen's lines: the game's own credits, then the four sections the brief asks for (the same","+// text is in the chat reply). Lines that start with # are headings. \"unknown\" marks what could not be confirmed.","+(() => {","+'use strict';","+const WP = globalThis.WP;","+","+WP.CREDITS = [","+  ...WP.ABOUT,","+  '',","+  '#SOURCE INFORMATION',","+  'DATE: 2026-11-03 18:50:13',","+  'SOURCE: OPERATION WOLF (TAITO, 1987)',","+  'PLAN: PLAN.MD (WRITTEN FOR THE GAME, BUILT FROM IT)',","+  'GENRE: FIRST-PERSON LIGHT-GUN RAIL SHOOTER (SHOOTER)',","+  'PERSPECTIVE: FIRST PERSON ON A SCRIPTED RAIL, SIDEWAYS AND IN DEPTH',","+  'TECH: MY-3D2DGE ENGINE 0.85.2 (HANDOFF), JAVASCRIPT, 480X270 PIXEL CANVAS',","+  'ART DIRECTION: PIXEL ART MADE IN CODE, DEPTH-SCALED, DUSK AND DAWN PALETTES',","+  'ANIMATION: PROCEDURAL (RISE AND DROP FROM COVER, CLOSING RINGS, RECOIL)',","+  'AUDIO: ENGINE CHIP SYNTH, SFX AND VOICE BLIPS IN CODE; ENGINE SONGS',","+  'ONLINE: NONE (AI HUB MULTIPLAYER NOT BUILT)',","+  'TESTING: BOT PLAYTHROUGHS, UNIT CHECKS, SCREENSHOTS IN CHROMIUM',","+  'RESEARCH: NONE OF MY OWN; THE PLAN\\'S SUMMARY OF THE SOURCE',","+  'ENVIRONMENT: CLAUDE CODE CLI (HEADLESS); LINUX (WSL2); CHROMIUM',","+  'MODEL: ANTHROPIC, CLAUDE-HAIKU-5-5, REASONING EFFORT MEDIUM',","+  'USAGE: UNKNOWN',","+  '',","+  '#TESTING FEEDBACK',","+  'ISSUES CAUGHT: ABOUT EIGHT. TWO WERE BREAKING IN A BROWSER: THE CANVAS',","+  'DREW AT 300X150 (THE PAGE CSS WAS MISSING), AND THE FIRST FRAME RAN',","+  'BEFORE THE BOT FILE LOADED (A CRASH ON A DEEP LINK INTO ATTRACT).',","+  'OTHERS: THE OP2 QUOTA SHORT (HOSTAGE GUARDS NOT COUNTED), A RETURN',","+  'FROM DEV THAT WOULD RESTART THE BATTLE, HUD AND DEV LAYOUT OVERLAP.',","+  'MOST HELPFUL: THE BOT PLAYS EACH OPERATION TO ITS BOSS HEADLESS, AND',","+  'THE SCREENSHOTS, WHICH SHOWED THE CANVAS AND LAYOUT PROBLEMS.',","+  'LEAST HELPFUL: THE STUB-BUFFER DRAW PASS. IT ONLY SHOWS NO EXCEPTION.',","+  '',","+  '#ENGINE FEEDBACK',","+  'MOST LIKED: E.GAME GIVES SCENES, PAUSE, SETTINGS, INPUT PRESETS, AUDIO',","+  'AND A HEADLESS LOOP FOR TESTS. E.ARCADE GIVES THE TABLE AND INITIALS.',","+  'STUCK OR GUESSED: THE CANVAS SIZE (THE TEMPLATE CSS, COPIED), THE',","+  'FIRST FRAME RUNNING BEFORE LATER FILES LOAD, AND THE HASH DEEP LINKS.',","+  'MOST BUILT BY HAND: THE BATTLE RULES, THE RAIL AND BEAT GENERATOR,',","+  'THE TELEGRAPH RINGS, THE DEPTH PAINTER, THE HUD, AND THE BOT.',","+  'HARDEST: THE API CARD IS LONG AND THE PIXEL FUNCTIONS SNAP TO WHOLE',","+  'PIXELS, SO SCALED SPRITES NEED A RUN-LENGTH PAINTER OF MY OWN.',","+  'CHANGED IN THE ENGINE: NONE.',","+  'ONE CHANGE I WOULD MAKE: A CLEAR RULE FOR CANVAS SIZE WITH A FIXED RES.',","+  '',","+  '#PROMPT FEEDBACK',","+  'MOST LIKED: THE PLAN\\'S EXACT NAMES, FILES, TESTS AND DONE CRITERIA.',","+  'CONFUSING: THE TASK AND THE PLAN ASK FOR FAR MORE THAN ONE RUN FITS',","+  '(SIX OPERATIONS, AI HUB, LOCAL CO-OP, RIGS, MODE 7), AND THE PLAN',","+  'NAMES A DIFFERENT MODEL AND EFFORT FROM THE TASK. THE TASK WON.',","+  'HARDEST: MULTIPLAYER INTEGRATION, WHICH NEEDS THE HUB HARNESS.',","+  'WOULD CHANGE: SPLIT IT INTO MILESTONES, EACH WITH ITS OWN DONE LINE.',","+];","+})();"]}],"originalFile":"(() => { 'use strict'; globalThis.WP.CREDITS = globalThis.WP.ABOUT; })();\n","userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01URsBje8UPxCfnqbZXHXojk","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
